  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_TYPE_SCULPT has the value 7</p>
  <p>PRIM_TYPE_SCULPT is a parameter of <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_TYPE" target="_blank">PRIM_TYPE</a> used to make a prim into a sculpty of specific shape and type.</p>
  <p><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Sculpted_Prims:_FAQ" target="_blank">Sculpted Prims: FAQ</a></p>
</p>
    </div>

